WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:04.539
The fox lay on a school anatomy table. I knew the organ

00:00:04.539 --> 00:00:06.925
names, but had never seen their arrangement.

00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:17.899
I brought a microscope home from Cairo. In Qatar, I

00:00:17.899 --> 00:00:21.348
could sit with a specimen until I understood what I

00:00:21.348 --> 00:00:21.693
saw.

00:00:29.450 --> 00:00:33.085
Our chemistry group started with plant extracts. Their

00:00:33.085 --> 00:00:36.265
colour was visible immediately; their composition took

00:00:36.265 --> 00:00:38.537
harder questions and better instruments.

00:00:44.450 --> 00:00:47.907
One imine sensor changed colour with cyanide. The

00:00:47.907 --> 00:00:51.797
absorbance spectrum said more than a photograph of the

00:00:51.797 --> 00:00:52.661
orange solution.

00:00:58.450 --> 00:01:02.630
We founded an ACS student chapter. Twenty-nine students

00:01:02.630 --> 00:01:05.765
trained on instruments through chapter activities.

00:01:08.450 --> 00:01:11.775
I wanted a polymer to assemble as our proposal

00:01:11.775 --> 00:01:14.730
required. The sample photographed here took a different

00:01:14.730 --> 00:01:16.577
course. We kept that record.

00:01:24.450 --> 00:01:27.821
In zebrafish, developing cranial vessels were visible,

00:01:27.821 --> 00:01:31.674
and blood moved. Turning that movement into defensible

00:01:31.674 --> 00:01:33.600
measurements was another problem.

00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:42.167
I oriented zebrafish specimens in agarose before

00:01:42.167 --> 00:01:45.884
paraffin embedding. At the microtome, the materials

00:01:45.884 --> 00:01:48.539
separated. No usable section emerged.

00:01:52.450 --> 00:01:56.431
In our lung study, an air bubble passed over cultured

00:01:56.431 --> 00:01:59.616
epithelial cells. We measured injury after the moving

00:01:59.616 --> 00:02:00.811
interface reached them.

00:02:07.450 --> 00:02:12.174
A polymer surface changes which molecules or cells it

00:02:12.174 --> 00:02:15.324
encounters. Bulk composition alone cannot describe

00:02:15.324 --> 00:02:16.899
everything happening there.

00:02:20.450 --> 00:02:24.284
My inhaled dexamethasone project asks whether vesicles

00:02:24.284 --> 00:02:28.118
can survive nebulization before reaching the lung.

00:02:31.450 --> 00:02:34.335
Centuries earlier, Cairo pharmacists wrote about

00:02:34.335 --> 00:02:37.700
preparations changing after manufacture. I read those

00:02:37.700 --> 00:02:41.547
recipes with a laboratory question: what did the

00:02:41.547 --> 00:02:42.989
finished medicine become?
